  "line": 237,
  "title": "Protect a reloaded App key path as soon as it is validated, not only at startup",
  "detail": "Thank you: all three round-1 fixes held in review.\n- Startup registers the key in both spellings, and real Seatbelt agent and gate probes deny reads of it, with an allowed-read control that succeeds.\n- The `--repo` body, `-f body=--repo x/y` and a `--body` holding another repository's URL all keep the App token.\n- At the next signing, a key that is 0644, symlinked, not a regular file or owned by another user fails closed with a clear reason and no key contents.\n- The tests fail without the round.\n\nOne gap remains. When a config reload (#807) changes `[github.app] private_key_path`, the reload validates the new path and reports `restartRequired: [\"github.app.private_key_path\"]`, so the old key stays active and protected. The new path, though, is never registered with `protectPrivateFile`.\n\nProbe: two synthetic 0600 keys outside the config directory. After the reload, the new path is absent from `privateReadPaths()`, and a fresh Seatbelt agent read probe can read the new key while the old one is denied.\n\nFix: register every validated `private_key_path` with `protectPrivateFile` as soon as the reload accepts it, before any agent or gate can start, and keep it registered until shutdown (the same `privateFiles` lifetime as the startup registration). A pending key is a credential too. Don't release the old key's protection while it is still the active key.\n\nTest, which must fail without the fix: after a reload that changes the path, both the old and the new key paths, in both spellings, are in `privateReadPaths()`.\n\nOptional, for consistency: pass the repository explicitly in the five remaining calls that still infer it. Review showed they select the App token correctly today. They are in src/pipeline/review-round.ts (the PR view near line 105, and the auto-merge cancellation near 205) and src/pipeline/shadow-report.ts (the three history calls near lines 44, 49 and 62).\n\nRun only test/github-app.test.ts test/config-reload.test.ts test/github-notifier.test.ts, `bunx biome check` on the changed files and `bunx tsc --noEmit`. Never run the full suite in a factory run (AGENTS.md)."
